  "application_type_full": "Householder planning permission",
  "description": "The proposal consists of the demolition of the side façade and roof of the existing rear outrigger and the construction of a new single-storey rear extension. The works include: • New Douglas Fir timber frame extension with standing seam metal roof and projecting timber-clad rooflight. • Triple-glazed aluminium-clad timber windows and a new external door. • Removal of side entrance door, replaced with a window retaining the appearance of a door. • Lowering of garden level adjacent to the extension to match internal floor level, with existing solid decking replaced with a permeable surface. • Minor internal alterations to the ground floor kitchen and WC layout. • Hard landscaping works including new steps and bench integrated into the garden. • No new vehicle access or alterations to the highway are proposed. All proposed dimensions, siting, and construction details are indicated on the accompanying drawings (ref: 10_P_PR.pdf to 14_E_PR.pdf).",
